            <ArticleTitle>'Lysinibacillus saudimassiliensis' sp. nov., a new bacterial species isolated from air samples in the urban environment of Makkah, Saudi Arabia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>25-27</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.nmni.2016.12.011</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report here the main characteristics of 'Lysinibacillus saudimassiliensis' strain 13S34_airτ (CSUR = P1222), a new species of the Lysinibacillus genus that was isolated from air samples in the city environment of Makkah, Saudi Arabia, during the pilgrim period of Hajj 2012.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
